# Generated outputs
# outputs/images/ is tracked — the text2img samples are a few MB each and are
# worth having in the repo. The rest stay ignored because they are large:
# panoramas are 4096x2048, texture packs ship several maps per material, SDS
# writes an intermediate every 100 iterations, and LoRA weights are binaries.
outputs/panoramas/
outputs/textures/
outputs/sds/
outputs/lora_weights/
outputs/logs/

